            "review_title": "Review at Ô Bún Chả An Thượng 26",
            "review_text": "Jaeheon Cho\nBucheon, South Korea71 contributions\n0\nBreakfast Recommendations\nFeb 2024 • Family\nI visited Da Nang twice. The menu consists of a bowl of tea and three simple side dishes, but the taste is faithful to the basics without being too overpowering. In particular, grilled buncha is prepared in the morning, so if you visit at the start of the morning (9:00 am), you can taste freshly grilled buncha.\nShow original\nWritten February 9, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
