            "review_text": "Ô Bún Chả An Thượng Đà Nẵng\nDa Nang, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nA memorable experience of typical Hanoi dishes and will definitely come back\nAug 2023 • Family\nThe marinated meat is rich and delicious. Add some carrots and green papaya to the broth, it's crunchy and delicious, the herbs are fresh, beautifully decorated, the small space of the restaurant is decorated with lots of hats, especially outside. There is a small Koi fish tank with a very pleasant gurgling sound\nShow original\nWritten September 8, 2023",
